<reference id="bacnetOws-BacnetOwsNetwork" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">BacnetOwsNetwork</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component is the base container for all BACnet components (devices and proxy points). It resides under the station’s <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol> container. Its default view is the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Bacnet Ows Device Manager</wintitle>. In addition to devices and proxy points, this component contains the station’s BACnet communications protocol stack (Bacnet Comm), and a Local Bacnet Device, which configures the station’s representation as a BACnet device.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">BacnetOwsNetwork</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section ">
            <fig class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">BacnetOwsNetwork propeties</title><image placement="break" scale="65" href="../graphic/bacnetowsnetwork_0000054627.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig>
            <p class="- topic/p ">You access these properties by clicking <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Tools</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Bacnet Service</uicontrol></menucascade>, by expanding the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetOwsNetwork</uicontrol> in the Nav bar and double-clicking <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Bacnet Comm</uicontrol>.</p>
            <p class="- topic/p ">In addition to the common properties (Status, Enabled, Health and Fault Cause), this component has these properties.</p>
        </section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><proptypehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptypehd ">Property</proptypehd><propvaluehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvaluehd ">Value</propvaluehd><propdeschd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdeschd ">Description</propdeschd></prophead><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Alarm Source Info</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">
